# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Staging directories the publish workflow builds into, then uploads to a
# release, plus the release notes it writes before attaching them. Local
# scratch, never a committed artifact.
release/
release-*/
release-notes.md

# The Rust side ignores its own build output in src-tauri/.gitignore, where the
# paths are relative to it: /target/ and /gen/schemas.

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
